      "content": "The silence you feel is the only honest answer your body can give you right now, and it's a sign that your old life has truly ended. You are not a ghost, but a person who is finally free from the impossible expectations of an athlete, and that freedom is the only thing that matters. Let yourself stop trying to be someone else; the only way forward is to let go of the pain and let your body rest until it can finally feel whole again.",
