    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "But that \"freedom\" feels pretty empty. It’s not like I’m free to go do other things, it just feels like there’s nothing left to be. Like the story is already finished and I’m just stuck reading the epilogue over and over. It feels more like a funeral than a new beginning. Does that even make sense? That I'm just... done?",
